   = note: over a fallible value a row arm covers one tag of the row, a value pattern covers values
     of the ok type, and `_` covers whatever is left on both halves ([type.row.match]).
   = note: add arms for the missing cases, or end the `match` with a `_` arm to catch the rest
     deliberately.
